    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tips:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demo only shows the gameplay and mechanics of the game, which may differ from the official version;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo save data will not be inherited by the official version;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demo playable content is approximately 8% of the official game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Storyline</strong>\uff1a<br>Guretvo, a millennium-old continent. The rule of the Golden Dragon family has become increasingly corrupt. The White Church has launched a monstrous rebellion. The gods beyond the realm have begun to meddle here one after another and sent envoys of the gods. With the power of the God of Sith from the West, the White Church was suppressed. Master William, an unyielding rebel, crossed the sea to the east, learned new powers from the Eagle God from the East, and with the help of Leon, the God of the North, founded the Cyan Church and the Red Church. Unexpectedly, William suddenly passed away just before the army set out on the northern expedition, which led to a series of betrayals and internal strife. After the &quot;Night of the Massacre&quot;, the Cyan Church and the Red Church went their separate ways. The Dragon Academy, as a church school founded by William, also forced the apprentices to choose their own paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Size</strong>\uff1a<br>The game includes a total of 6 main levels. Except for the main city level of Lonserf, each level is massive and features traditional Souls-like sandbox levels. The game includes a total of 10 boss battles and over 80 different AI combat encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voiceover &amp; Subtitles</strong>\uff1a<br>The game includes both Chinese and English voiceovers, with multi-language subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>\uff1a</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemy attack moves<br>Basic combo attacks, dangerous strikes, fatal attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/fc1f1835ffb8e3e445b850e4d452fb0f.poster.avif?t=1754564013\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/fc1f1835ffb8e3e445b850e4d452fb0f.webm?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/fc1f1835ffb8e3e445b850e4d452fb0f.mp4?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-layered enemy counter mechanisms and rewards<br>Mikiri counter, dodge, parry, gun counter, riposte</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/3d586034f0bf2a00d5dada5a4748e462.poster.avif?t=1754564013\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/3d586034f0bf2a00d5dada5a4748e462.webm?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/3d586034f0bf2a00d5dada5a4748e462.mp4?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic and stirring historical adventure storyline<br>Multiple church factions compete for the right to lead Gurettvo, involving conspiracies, grudges, grand historical trends, and the victory of ideals and beliefs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/f23a7f29116f0dfd2bec883134464f8c.poster.avif?t=1754564013\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/f23a7f29116f0dfd2bec883134464f8c.webm?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/f23a7f29116f0dfd2bec883134464f8c.mp4?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various items, skills, and martial arts to &quot;abuse&quot; bosses<br>Items, skills, martial arts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
